Control Center: while searching, the group sidebar shows only matching groups.

The stock group proxy filtered on column 2 with Qt::UserRole, which is the
group's Comment; group .desktop files have none, so the sidebar never
narrowed. Replace it with a small proxy that keeps exactly the groups that
contain a module matching the search (all groups when the search is empty).

Applies on top of patches 07 and 20.

